# Not a git ignore file. Read by tools built on Rust's `ignore` crate, which
# includes Ark, the R language server behind Positron.
#
# Ark's workspace indexer panics with a salsa dependency-graph cycle on this
# repo. That kills the language server, which (among other things) makes
# Cmd+Enter execute single lines instead of whole statements, because the
# statement-range provider it backs disappears.
#
# The files below are the ones that source() another file in their OWN
# directory, which is the edge the cycle appears to need.
R/generate_figures.R
